abstract: SYMFLUENCE is a computational environmental modeling platform that streamlines the hydrological
  modeling workflow from domain setup through data acquisition, model execution, calibration, and evaluation.
  A four-tier layered architecture governed by typed component registries integrates hydrological models
  spanning multiple programming languages and modeling paradigms, unified through declarative YAML configuration
  with provenance captured by default.
